                                [ A N U B I S ]

We use this cute anti-scraper software called **Anubis**, it's very helpful, and *surely* fun to use or configure.

Jokes aside, we're using this to combat the Dead-Internet-Theory amount of bots in the web, PoW works but it's resource-heavy and just bullshitize your work.

So our only solution for now (and thankfully found it with the help of my friends) is Anubis.

https://github.com/techarohq/anubis
https://ghcr.io/techarohq/anubis
